Package: unconfoundedr
Title: Test Unconfoundedness by Comparing RCT and Observational Effects
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Ribeiro", family = "Diogo", role = c("aut","cre"),
                    email = "diogo.debastos.ribeiro@gmail.com"))
Description: Provides a hypothesis test for unmeasured confounding by
    comparing a marginal treatment effect estimated in an RCT-like dataset
    with the same estimand in an observational dataset. Includes IPW and
    AIPW (doubly-robust) estimators, bootstrap CIs, Wald test based on the
    AIPW influence function, and basic overlap diagnostics.
